### 1. Healthcheck Server
GET http://localhost:3000/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Register Akun Mahasiswa Baru
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nim": "220101088",
  "nama": "Sarah Amalia",
  "email": "sarah@kampus.ac.id",
  "password": "passwordAman123"
}

### 3. Login Mahasiswa (Mendapatkan Access Token & Refresh Token)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aditya@kampus.ac.id",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 4. Ambil Feed Mobile (Batch 1 - Cursor Awal, Limit 3)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/feed?limit=3
Accept: application/json

### 5. Ambil Feed Mobile (Batch 2 - Lanjutan dengan Cursor)
# Ganti cursor dengan post id yang didapatkan dari batch 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/feed?limit=3&cursor=post_0198
Accept: application/json

### 6. Buat Postingan Baru dari Mobile (Wajib Bearer Token & Idempotency Key)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/feed
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Idempotency-Key: mobile-req-uuid-1001

{
  "caption": "Mencoba integrasi REST API ke aplikasi smartphone via Vibe Coding! 📱⚡",
  "category": "DISKUSI",
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/400/300"
}

### 7. Uji Streaming AI Assistant via Server-Sent Events (SSE)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/ai/stream-assistant?query=Jelaskan+Cursor+Pagination
Accept: text/event-stream
